### Mass Balance Integrity
The co-current numerical IVP formulation enforces strict mass conservation. Across all simulated nodes, the element balance closure (C, H, O, N) remains strictly below 0.1% error (observed Base Case error: `{{ "%0.6f"|format(results_a['Base Case']['C_error']) }}%`).
